        "TileImage": "$($repository 2b305eb4-a0f9-4b30-a1f4-0e398cb6b95c).Image",
        "Description": "Sebastian Sato, make-up artist to the stars, has been spotted in Dubai after the shake up with Viktor Novikov in Paris. Helmut Krueger himself placed this contract, he claims that Sebastian failed to protect him after he woke up nude in the garden. While it is not Sato&apos;s responsibilty to make sure his models don&apos;t get choked out, Krueger paid up-front. Included in the contract is Richard Voltaire, because he looks like that weirdo from &quot;Phantasm&quot;. They both must be lethally poisoned. Good luck.",
